                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female given name. Used in Hawaii since the 1980s."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3163fd26-0d10-4bc2-9b60-c9675aeb0ed1",
                                                "sense_id": "8948e887-1e37-351f-a86b-9e757783d940",
                                                "text": "Tiare — her father had called her by the name of the white, scented flower which, they tell you, if you have once smelt, will always draw you back to Tahiti in the end, however far you may have roamed — Tiare remembered Strickland very well."
